- REVIEW: `TASK-260720-2284br` changes requested. Cycle-1 R1/R2 are closed: `KindEntry` journals default/explicit symlink mirrors and restores exact link destinations; stale adapter entries are class-80 removals before class-90 consumer state; the project+hybrid and global class sweeps cover their required target surfaces.
- FINDING: project closure reads `hybrid/Skillfile.json` before private staging and the manager-home commit lock (`internal/install/install.go:223-255`), but `observations` records and rechecks only installed marker paths and cache outcomes (`install.go:411-424`, `internal/install/commit.go:213-283`). The commit comment claims stale activation is revalidated, but the hybrid activation manifest is absent from `generationPaths`.
